1
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:46,319
Let's get wild!

2
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:46,840
Brother Biao.

3
00:01:47,159 --> 00:01:48,680
Someone outside is looking for Sister Na.

4
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,760
He started a fight with our guys.

5
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,400
It's just one guy, what the hell are you scared of?

6
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,079
Tell him to beat it.

7
00:01:52,239 --> 00:01:53,840
Brother Wei and the boys couldn't take him down.

8
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:58,400
Someone's here for you.

9
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,120
I'll go check it out.

10
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:01,760
All right, go ahead.

11
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,640
Come on, let's keep going.

12
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,479
Stop it!

13
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,680
Brother Biao.

14
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:23,199
He's here to trash the place.

15
00:02:23,199 --> 00:02:24,520
Shut up!

16
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:29,280
Who is it?

17
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:30,560
I'm looking for Xu Na,

18
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:32,080
to ask where my sister is.

19
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,039
Looking for who?

20
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,560
Looking for Xu Na.

21
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:37,879
Looking for Xu Na?

22
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:39,919
Xu Na is my girl.

23
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:41,560
Come on.

24
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,039
Bring it.

25
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,439
It's nothing. Keep partying, everyone!

26
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:50,080
You probably don't realize how serious this is.

27
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:52,560
Trafficking large quantities of drugs

28
00:02:53,319 --> 00:02:54,759
can carry the death penalty.

29
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:57,560
Your case is measured in kilograms.

30
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,039
I don't know anything about drugs.

31
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:02,879
Those packages belong to my boyfriend.

32
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,960
I only picked them up for him.

33
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,680
I had no idea what was inside!

34
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,120
Similar facial masks

35
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:15,360
were shipped from Jiangyang to you three times.

36
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,919
All three times,

37
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,919
you were completely in the dark?

38
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:21,520
I was just picking up packages for my boyfriend.

39
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,639
When those masks reached my place,

40
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,879
I never even opened them.

41
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:27,319
He took them right away every time.

42
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:30,080
Fine.

43
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,280
What's your boyfriend's name?

44
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:34,520
Where's he from, and what does he do?

45
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,520
When did you meet him?

46
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,719
I don't know him that well.

47
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:40,599
He said he was on a business trip in Nanhai,

48
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,680
kept switching hotels,

49
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,879
and couldn't receive packages easily.

50
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,680
So they were all sent to my place.

51
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,759
I don't even know what his job is.

52
00:03:46,919 --> 00:03:48,000
Do you honestly believe that yourself?

53
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,280
Officer,

54
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,439
it's not like this is my first man.

55
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:53,479
Why should I care what his name is?

56
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:55,400
Does a name even matter?

57
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,759
We suspect you of possessing drugs.

58
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,960
The evidence is conclusive.

59
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,000
If you cooperate,

60
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,879
the court might give you a lighter sentence.

61
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:03,360
But everything you're talking about,

62
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,960
I know nothing about it.

63
00:04:05,439 --> 00:04:06,840
What do you expect me to confess?

64
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,919
Zhuang Yan has really met his match this time.

65
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:27,000
Your boyfriend is Qian Feng, from Jiangyang.

66
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,360
He used to be a buyer for a state-owned enterprise.

67
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,360
You've known each other for over six months.

68
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:31,519
And you did more than just receive shipments for him.

69
00:04:31,839 --> 00:04:32,439
Right?

70
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:39,879
We're asking you

71
00:04:40,439 --> 00:04:42,480
not because we don't already know.

72
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,600
I'm giving you time now

73
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,079
to think carefully

74
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:49,560
about what the consequences will be.

75
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,279
Gao Min refuses to confess.

76
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:55,120
She's probably still holding out hope for Qian Feng.

77
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:09,079
Zhuang Yan.

78
00:05:09,839 --> 00:05:10,720
Take a few guys tomorrow

79
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:13,319
and stake out the Black Panther Club for a few days.

80
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:13,839
Got it.

81
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,759
Never thought that so soon,

82
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:19,720
Psychedelic Blues would make a comeback.

83
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,560
This is just the beginning.

84
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:24,600
The real show is yet to come.

85
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,800
Is Liang Wenbiao, Boss Liang, here?

86
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:28,040
Come on, let's party!

87
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,879
Bro, how is it?

88
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:30,399
I'm good.

89
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:31,439
Come on, drink up!

90
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:32,639
Drink. Keep drinking.

91
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,519
Who's this guy?

92
00:07:26,319 --> 00:07:27,000
No idea.

93
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:29,839
He's here to trash the place.

94
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:34,759
I can tell.

95
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:39,199
Good.

96
00:07:39,639 --> 00:07:40,800
Saves us the trouble.

97
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,519
That was brutal.

98
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:05,879
What do you want?

99
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:15,720
Where's Zhao Xinjie?

100
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,839
No, please! Bro...

101
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,720
Take it easy. I'll go with you.

102
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:32,879
Help!

103
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:35,600
Boss!

104
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:39,600
Are you okay, Boss?

105
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,039
Liang Wenbiao.

106
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,399
What do you think you're doing?

107
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,039
Easy, take it easy!

108
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:15,320
B-Bro, don't get the wrong idea!

109
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,559
I never messed with your sister.

110
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,679
We're classmates.

111
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,879
She was the one who came to me.

112
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:21,559
Why did Xinjie come to you?

113
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:22,960
She said she didn't want to go home,

114
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,000
and asked me to help her find work.

115
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,559
So I introduced her to Boss Zhang.

116
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:28,360
Don't worry.

117
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:29,480
Boss Zhang is a good guy.

118
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,519
He won't do anything to your sister.

119
00:09:30,519 --> 00:09:31,600
Why did you get her hooked on drugs?

120
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,559
Tell Four-Legged Snake when you see him...

121
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,480
from now on, your club only sells my stuff.

122
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,279
I don't even know this Four-Legged Snake!

123
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:55,200
I just do the bouncing here!

124
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:56,360
Drugs?

125
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,120
I don't touch that stuff at all!

126
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:09,639
I'll tell him.

127
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:11,759
I'll pass the message along.

128
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:15,159
That's more like it.

129
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,360
Business is business.

130
00:10:20,279 --> 00:10:21,960
It's all about making money.

131
00:10:23,279 --> 00:10:25,720
Don't worry. Work with me,

132
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:27,519
and I guarantee you'll make more than before.

133
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:31,360
I know you have some big clients.

134
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,320
Here's the deal.

135
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,039
I'll give you three days.

136
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:37,559
Help me move three kilos of Psychedelic Blues.

137
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:40,039
In three days, my boy will contact you.

138
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:42,559
If you pull this deal off for me,

139
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,440
I'll give you...

140
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:46,519
ten percent.

141
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:48,840
Got it?

142
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:52,799
Okay.

143
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:54,559
Fine.

144
00:11:03,639 --> 00:11:05,080
My grades were bad back in 11th grade,

145
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,120
so I dropped out of school.

146
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,440
For a long time after that,

147
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,960
I wasn't in touch with Zhao Xinjie.

148
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,480
One day, I bumped into her by chance.

149
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:11,679
Seeing how down she was,

150
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:13,320
a few friends and I hung out with her.

151
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,240
When she came looking for me this time,

152
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,440
she wasn't herself at all.

153
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,080
She said she could never go back home.

154
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,200
She also said she wanted to make money—

155
00:11:20,399 --> 00:11:21,440
a whole lot of money.

156
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,480
It just so happened Boss Zhang

157
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:25,120
was looking for a young girl as a secretary.

158
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:25,840
I figured

159
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,600
this was way better than working at Black Panther Club,

160
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,559
so I introduced them.

161
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,240
Boss Zhang said after tonight,

162
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,440
once the interview was done,

163
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:35,039
he'd give her a large sum of money.

164
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:37,480
And how much was Boss Zhang going to pay you afterward?

165
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:43,720
H-He said he'd give me 50,000 as a fee.

166
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,120
For 50,000 yuan...

167
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,080
This isn't your first time doing this, is it?

168
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:55,279
You specialize in finding schoolgirls

169
00:11:55,279 --> 00:11:56,480
for wealthy bosses, don't you?

170
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,879
From the moment you got Xinjie on drugs,

171
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:03,399
you've been scheming against her step by step,

172
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:04,919
all just so one day...

173
00:12:04,919 --> 00:12:06,399
you could sell her off.

174
00:12:06,519 --> 00:12:08,000
I never forced anyone!

175
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,320
Besides, after everything was done,

176
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,960
they were all pretty grateful to me.

177
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,559
Grateful?

178
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,480
Red.

179
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,519
Yellow.

180
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:28,919
And what else?

181
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,879
Black.

182
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:32,320
Is there black too?

183
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:32,879
Right.

184
00:12:32,879 --> 00:12:33,519
Right?

185
00:12:33,519 --> 00:12:35,759
So what number does it say right here?

186
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:36,480
Four.

187
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:37,039
Four.

188
00:12:37,039 --> 00:12:39,840
So we color four goldfish, right?

189
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,080
Yeah.

190
00:12:40,399 --> 00:12:40,679
Okay.

191
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:41,559
Colorful.

192
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,639
So colorful, isn't it?

193
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:49,919
Mom, why isn't Dad home yet?

194
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:53,720
Dad's class has college entrance exams coming up,

195
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:55,720
so he's really busy these days.

196
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,360
I'll stay with you, okay?

197
00:12:57,919 --> 00:12:59,759
Then stay with me more, Mom.

198
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:01,759
I like doing homework with you.

199
00:13:02,279 --> 00:13:03,039
You got it!

200
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:05,879
Keep writing.

201
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,080
Where's the location?

202
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,480
Okay, I'll take care of it.

203
00:13:20,639 --> 00:13:22,320
Mom, are you leaving?

204
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,559
I'm not going anywhere.

205
00:13:26,759 --> 00:13:29,240
My only mission today is to stay with Huanhuan.

206
00:13:29,679 --> 00:13:30,480
Yay!

207
00:13:32,919 --> 00:13:33,559
Let's get back to it.

208
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,240
Where is this?

209
00:14:38,279 --> 00:14:38,960
Where's my friend?

210
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:43,159
This is the finest hotel in Nanhai.

211
00:14:44,399 --> 00:14:45,120
Tonight...

212
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,360
...we can really enjoy ourselves.

213
00:14:49,799 --> 00:14:50,919
What are you talking about?

214
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,919
Wasn't this supposed to be an interview?

215
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,639
This is the interview.

216
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:02,240
You'll be working with me from now on,

217
00:15:03,639 --> 00:15:05,279
and we'll often be out drinking with clients.

218
00:15:05,799 --> 00:15:06,919
If you can't drink, that won't do.

219
00:15:07,879 --> 00:15:09,440
Come on, finish this glass.

220
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:12,720
I'm sorry, I can't drink anymore.

221
00:15:12,879 --> 00:15:13,679
My head hurts.

222
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:17,279
Sister Na...

223
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:21,039
Where's Sister Na? When is she coming to pick me up?

224
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,960
She already handed you over to me.

225
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,799
Why would she come back for you?

226
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,080
Don't worry.

227
00:15:29,919 --> 00:15:31,080
Once the interview is over,

228
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,000
wherever you want to go,

229
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,639
that's where I'll take you.

230
00:15:33,919 --> 00:15:35,000
What are you doing?!

231
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:49,240
What are you doing?

232
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,279
Let go!

233
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,679
Sister Na!

234
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:52,960
Sister Na!

235
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:54,440
Help!

236
00:15:54,879 --> 00:15:57,240
Sister Na! Sister Na!

237
00:15:57,679 --> 00:15:58,480
Let go!

238
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:01,799
What do you think you're doing?

239
00:16:02,159 --> 00:16:02,919
Running a badger game?

240
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:26,679
It's okay, it's okay.

241
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,159
Come with me.

242
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:29,559
Let's go.

243
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:36,799
Boss Zhang.

244
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:39,840
Boss Zhang, are you okay?

245
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:43,759
You... You...

246
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:46,639
I... I was forced into this too!

247
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:53,240
Police! Police!

248
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:53,879
Don't move! Don't move!

249
00:16:53,919 --> 00:16:54,559
No, it wasn't me!

250
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:55,600
I had... had nothing to do with this!

251
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,000
It had nothing to do with me!

252
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,400
Keep up.

253
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:46,759
Brother Qiang, we've visited so many joints,

254
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,559
but haven't seen this Four-Legged Snake at all.

255
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:51,000
Do you think he heard our reputation

256
00:17:51,079 --> 00:17:52,119
and ran off scared?

257
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,039
It's not that simple.

258
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,079
We've only been away from Nanhai for a few months,

259
00:17:56,759 --> 00:17:57,359
and this snake

260
00:17:57,359 --> 00:17:59,279
has already built a booming business.

261
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:01,279
We just got back a few days ago,

262
00:18:01,279 --> 00:18:03,119
yet we haven't even caught a glimpse of him.

263
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:06,000
Now we're out in the open, while he's in the shadows.

264
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,400
When you go out to handle business from now on,

265
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:09,599
you have to be careful.

266
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:11,839
Come on, Brother Qiang.

267
00:18:12,519 --> 00:18:14,039
I doubt anyone in Nanhai City

268
00:18:14,039 --> 00:18:15,640
would dare go head-to-head with us.

269
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:19,599
Before we came, the boss warned us repeatedly

270
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:23,000
that it's best to be careful in everything we do.

271
00:18:24,799 --> 00:18:26,519
Even though things have gone smoothly lately,

272
00:18:27,079 --> 00:18:29,240
I still feel like something is off.

273
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,680
Ever since Wu Liang was arrested,

274
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,680
many of our downlines have been exposed.

275
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,960
Our business in Nanhai...

276
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:38,440
who knows how much longer it can last.

277
00:18:40,799 --> 00:18:41,680
The boss said

278
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:46,000
he'll pull us out of Nanhai if there's a chance.

279
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:48,920
I just hope everything stays safe and quiet until then.

280
00:18:59,160 --> 00:18:59,920
What's wrong, Brother Qiang?

281
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,240
There's a car following us.

282
00:19:04,079 --> 00:19:05,160
It looks kind of familiar.

283
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:10,240
Could it be the cops?

284
00:19:32,759 --> 00:19:33,799
Their car suddenly turned right,

285
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:34,839
without signaling.

286
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,000
They've probably spotted us.

287
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:36,799
Captain Bai said

288
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:38,279
not to spook the target under any circumstances.

289
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:39,640
Maybe we should pull back for now.

290
00:19:39,759 --> 00:19:41,480
No. This is a rare opportunity.

291
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,319
We might be able to find their hideout.

292
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:00,400
Go straight.

293
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,200
Loop around Changhui Road.

294
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,000
We're bound to cross paths at the Minle intersection.

295
00:20:09,519 --> 00:20:12,319
Bro, that car behind us is gone.

296
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,200
Guess we were mistaken.

297
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:18,559
Once we hit Minle Road, don't rush back.

298
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,599
Take a loop around Changshan Dam.

299
00:20:44,839 --> 00:20:45,200
This is bad.

300
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:47,240
Past here is Changshan Dam.

301
00:20:47,839 --> 00:20:49,119
There's a deserted stretch of road just ahead.

302
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,279
Barely any traffic goes through there.

303
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,559
If we keep following like this,

304
00:20:52,759 --> 00:20:53,559
we'll blow our cover.

305
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,440
What do we do now?

306
00:20:55,119 --> 00:20:56,960
Should we call off the tail?

307
00:20:58,039 --> 00:20:59,559
We're in the front car's line of sight now.

308
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:01,160
If they're testing us

309
00:21:01,319 --> 00:21:02,119
and we suddenly stop,

310
00:21:02,319 --> 00:21:03,359
it'll give away our operation.

311
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:08,680
Maintain current speed.

312
00:21:11,119 --> 00:21:12,039
Once we pass this deserted stretch,

313
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:12,759
turn off immediately.

314
00:21:13,359 --> 00:21:13,759
All right.

315
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:09,480
What do we do?

316
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:11,400
Don't panic.

317
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,000
Get out of the car.

318
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:34,960
Get out!

319
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:36,319
Come out!

320
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:36,960
Get out of the car!

321
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:43,400
Step out!

322
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:45,400
Get out!

323
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:48,000
Out of the car!

324
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:51,279
Get out! Did you hear me?

325
00:22:51,759 --> 00:22:52,920
Don't shoot. Let them smash it.

326
00:22:54,799 --> 00:22:55,680
Get the hell out of the car!

327
00:22:57,559 --> 00:22:58,039
Come out!

328
00:23:03,119 --> 00:23:03,480
Step out!

329
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:09,519
Get out!

330
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:25,480
Let's go.

331
00:23:45,279 --> 00:23:45,640
Are you okay?

332
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:46,359
I'm fine.

333
00:23:47,359 --> 00:23:48,319
That was too close back there.

334
00:23:49,359 --> 00:23:50,480
I thought they spotted us.

335
00:23:50,759 --> 00:23:52,160
If shots were actually fired just now,

336
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:54,119
we probably would've died right there.

337
00:24:00,359 --> 00:24:00,920
Let's head back first.

338
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,880
Continue interrogating Gao Min.

339
00:24:10,440 --> 00:24:12,440
Liang Wenbiao used to be a contractor.

340
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:15,680
He was once summoned for coercing contract bids,

341
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:18,240
but because the victims were too scared to testify,

342
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:20,440
the case ended up dropped.

343
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,240
Two years ago,

344
00:24:22,359 --> 00:24:24,680
he gathered some street thugs

345
00:24:25,319 --> 00:24:26,599
and, using technical shares,

346
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:27,680
bought into Black Panther Club.

347
00:24:28,559 --> 00:24:29,640
On the surface,

348
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:32,279
he runs security for Black Panther Club,

349
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,319
but in reality,

350
00:24:33,519 --> 00:24:35,440
he carries out illicit activities.

351
00:24:35,519 --> 00:24:37,279
Drug trafficking is one of them.

352
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,440
Three months ago,

353
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:41,079
Psychedelic Blues appeared in Black Panther Club.

354
00:24:41,319 --> 00:24:42,359
Three months ago...

355
00:24:43,279 --> 00:24:45,359
That was around when Xiangdu Club was shut down?

356
00:24:45,599 --> 00:24:45,799
Right.

357
00:24:46,839 --> 00:24:48,279
Previously, we suspected

358
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:51,279
Wu Liang's boss, Ma Jingrong, was reorganizing,

359
00:24:52,039 --> 00:24:54,640
but recent leads all point to a man

360
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:56,240
known as Four-Legged Snake.

361
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,240
As for this guy,

362
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:59,119
we don't have any new leads yet.

363
00:25:00,119 --> 00:25:00,960
However, not long ago,

364
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:03,480
Ma Jingrong's man Li Qiang returned to Nanhai

365
00:25:03,599 --> 00:25:05,599
and clashed with Four-Legged Snake's men.

366
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:07,759
We think we can take advantage of this opportunity.

367
00:25:09,519 --> 00:25:11,759
Any leads on the logistics company case?

368
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,599
Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan are on it.

369
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:15,000
However, it's still uncertain

370
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:16,680
whether this case and Four-Legged Snake

371
00:25:16,680 --> 00:25:18,039
or Ma Jingrong's drug cartel

372
00:25:18,039 --> 00:25:18,960
are directly linked.

373
00:25:19,079 --> 00:25:21,599
From interrogating Xu Na and Zhang Keming,

374
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:22,599
we learned that

375
00:25:23,279 --> 00:25:24,680
over the past year, Xu Na

376
00:25:24,839 --> 00:25:25,880
used drugs as bait

377
00:25:26,079 --> 00:25:28,359
to lure young women into prostitution.

378
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:35,640
Liang Wenbiao is involved with many women,

379
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:37,759
and Xu Na is likely just one of them.

380
00:25:38,599 --> 00:25:41,960
Xu Na probably treated Liang Wenbiao as a shield,

381
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,920
As for what she was doing, Liang Wenbiao

382
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:45,279
probably didn't know much about it.

383
00:25:47,960 --> 00:25:49,559
Li Qiang's return to Nanhai

384
00:25:50,039 --> 00:25:51,279
is our chance to track down

385
00:25:51,279 --> 00:25:52,640
Ma Jingrong's whereabouts again.

386
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,799
Behind Liang Wenbiao and Four-Legged Snake,

387
00:25:56,039 --> 00:25:57,839
there must be a powerful drug cartel.

388
00:25:58,240 --> 00:26:00,279
Now, aside from Xu Duoduo,

389
00:26:00,559 --> 00:26:01,680
who is our main breakthrough,

390
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:04,319
we should focus our investigation

391
00:26:04,519 --> 00:26:05,480
on Black Panther Club.

392
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:09,960
The criminal syndicate we're facing

393
00:26:10,599 --> 00:26:12,519
has strong counter-reconnaissance skills.

394
00:26:13,119 --> 00:26:15,160
Judging from Wu Liang's case,

395
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:16,880
their distribution chain

396
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,240
was meticulously planned.

397
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:19,960
If we just arrest street dealers,

398
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:21,640
it'll be hard to root out the bosses.

399
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,079
That's why

400
00:26:23,079 --> 00:26:25,359
we changed the operation against Li Qiang

401
00:26:25,359 --> 00:26:27,599
from an arrest to surveillance and investigation.

402
00:26:27,799 --> 00:26:30,079
So regarding Black Panther Club and Liang Wenbiao,

403
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:31,960
we want to hold off for now,

404
00:26:32,319 --> 00:26:34,559
and request an undercover officer to infiltrate,

405
00:26:34,839 --> 00:26:36,079
to map out their network

406
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,720
and everyone involved,

407
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:39,599
before planning the bust.

408
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,759
With so few leads right now,

409
00:26:43,079 --> 00:26:44,359
this is probably our best option.

410
00:26:53,319 --> 00:26:54,480
What's this guy doing?

411
00:26:54,559 --> 00:26:55,799
Why is he playing video games all day?

412
00:27:05,720 --> 00:27:06,799
You've got sharp ears.

413
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:09,799
Even sharper than Karl in our K9 unit.

414
00:27:11,359 --> 00:27:12,039
Who's Karl?

415
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:14,240
A highly decorated police dog.

416
00:27:16,599 --> 00:27:19,480
What are you saying? You're unbelievable...

417
00:27:19,680 --> 00:27:21,200
Get away, or I'll bite you!

418
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:26,519
I'm the cop here.

419
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:27,720
At best, you're just

420
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:29,279
a good citizen assisting the police.

421
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:31,039
Didn't your captain say

422
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:32,839
I'm here to assist your investigation?

423
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:34,400
Investigation. Get it?

424
00:27:34,519 --> 00:27:35,680
She said "assist."

425
00:27:36,119 --> 00:27:37,200
Not "investigate."

426
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:45,160
You're climbing over the balcony again?

427
00:27:46,519 --> 00:27:47,640
I've been to his place.

428
00:27:47,839 --> 00:27:48,440
Nothing will happen.

429
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:49,680
But he's home right now.

430
00:27:49,799 --> 00:27:51,480
Won't you blow your cover doing that?

431
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:52,440
What else can we do?

432
00:27:52,599 --> 00:27:54,519
He's more hooked on gaming than drugs.

433
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:56,599
Who knows how long we'd have to wait for him?

434
00:27:57,759 --> 00:27:58,400
Hold on.

435
00:28:03,519 --> 00:28:04,599
Well, take it easy then.

436
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:06,640
Don't worry.

437
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:07,599
It'll be fine.

438
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:10,680
Be careful!

439
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:32,799
You scared me!

440
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:35,920
Be careful.

441
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:40,680
Slow down.

442
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:52,200
Go in! Push, push, push!

443
00:28:52,279 --> 00:28:53,000
Right! Nice!

444
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:55,240
Ulted! I used my ult! Follow up, follow up!

445
00:28:58,079 --> 00:28:58,720
Don't rush, don't rush.

446
00:28:58,720 --> 00:29:00,279
Come on, wait for the next wave. One more wave.

447
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:01,279
I still have HP! I still have HP!

448
00:29:01,839 --> 00:29:02,759
My health is still good.

449
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:07,880
Nice!

450
00:29:08,160 --> 00:29:09,160
Double kill!

451
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:11,079
Run! Run!

452
00:29:12,119 --> 00:29:12,599
Try and run!

453
00:29:14,400 --> 00:29:15,240
You think I won't poke you?

454
00:29:15,559 --> 00:29:18,119
Just watch me take you down!

455
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:27,599
Hook him!

456
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:28,640
Come on!

457
00:29:29,319 --> 00:29:30,559
Follow up! Follow me, follow me!

458
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:31,279
Come on, come on!

459
00:29:31,440 --> 00:29:32,640
Watch me wreck you!

460
00:29:33,519 --> 00:29:34,720
Nice!

461
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,160
Double kill!

462
00:29:37,519 --> 00:29:38,559
Chase them! Keep chasing, keep chasing!

463
00:29:38,559 --> 00:29:39,839
There's one more! One's at low health!

464
00:29:41,359 --> 00:29:42,319
I have heal! Here, popping it!

465
00:29:42,319 --> 00:29:42,880
I'm healing you.

466
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:46,599
Hold on a second.

467
00:30:05,119 --> 00:30:05,920
Here's your order.

468
00:30:06,319 --> 00:30:06,759
Sorry about that.

469
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:08,400
Could you be faster next time?

470
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:10,359
I'm really sorry.

471
00:30:10,359 --> 00:30:11,480
All right, head back. Go on.

472
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:40,920
You're back.

473
00:30:43,200 --> 00:30:43,839
I'm dead.

474
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:48,440
Anyway, I'm gonna eat soon.

475
00:30:48,519 --> 00:30:49,640
You... you guys go ahead and play.

476
00:31:20,799 --> 00:31:21,680
No, no, no.

477
00:31:22,359 --> 00:31:23,640
What if his phone isn't on silent?

478
00:31:43,640 --> 00:31:44,559
I'm not playing anymore.

479
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:46,599
Time for His Majesty to eat.

480
00:31:49,160 --> 00:31:51,519
Duoduo's secret recipe mini-burger!

481
00:32:13,920 --> 00:32:14,599
Who is it?

482
00:32:16,000 --> 00:32:16,640
Coming!

483
00:32:27,119 --> 00:32:28,000
Hey, gorgeous.

484
00:32:28,759 --> 00:32:29,480
What can I do for you?

485
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:32,880
D-Does your place have power?

486
00:32:33,319 --> 00:32:33,880
Yeah, I do.

487
00:32:35,559 --> 00:32:37,519
Then my breaker must've tripped.

488
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:40,480
C-Could you come take a look for me?

489
00:32:42,839 --> 00:32:43,960
You came to the right guy.

490
00:32:44,279 --> 00:32:46,319
Back at the factory, I was a level-two electrician.

491
00:32:47,880 --> 00:32:49,000
Th-That's great!

492
00:32:49,559 --> 00:32:51,680
C-Could you please check it for me?

493
00:32:51,839 --> 00:32:52,359
Sure.

494
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:54,279
Let me grab my tools.

495
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,079
Wait for me a second.

496
00:33:11,279 --> 00:33:12,559
Where's my toolbox hiding?

497
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:14,440
Come out!

498
00:33:15,799 --> 00:33:16,319
Get out here!

499
00:33:16,319 --> 00:33:17,079
Don't bother looking for tools.

500
00:33:17,799 --> 00:33:19,119
A breaker... A breaker probably tripped.

501
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:22,920
Really?

502
00:33:25,839 --> 00:33:26,319
It's fine.

503
00:33:27,160 --> 00:33:28,640
I can fix it with my bare hands.

504
00:33:44,039 --> 00:33:44,680
The power's really out.

505
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:47,799
Did you use a high-power appliance?

506
00:33:48,599 --> 00:33:50,480
Why else would the breaker trip out of nowhere?

507
00:33:54,519 --> 00:33:55,200
There you go.

508
00:33:58,079 --> 00:33:58,680
Thanks.

509
00:33:58,799 --> 00:33:59,359
No problem.

510
00:34:00,480 --> 00:34:01,920
If you ever need anything,

511
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:03,200
just let me know anytime.

512
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:04,319
Okay.

513
00:34:05,039 --> 00:34:05,599
Tell you what,

514
00:34:06,279 --> 00:34:07,400
I'll go grab my tools

515
00:34:07,839 --> 00:34:08,719
and check it over for you.

516
00:34:09,840 --> 00:34:10,360
Sounds good.

517
00:34:32,760 --> 00:34:33,760
Brother Qiang, nobody's here.

518
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:38,400
Thanks.

519
00:34:39,079 --> 00:34:40,199
I'll go back and grab some tools.

520
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:48,119
Brother Qiang.

521
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:51,159
Why didn't you call before coming over?

522
00:34:55,559 --> 00:34:57,199
Look, I have guests right now.

523
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:58,559
I'll check it over for you later.

524
00:34:59,079 --> 00:35:00,880
All right, you go ahead then.

525
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:01,559
Wait a minute.

526
00:35:19,719 --> 00:35:20,800
What's your name?

527
00:35:24,559 --> 00:35:25,119
I...

528
00:35:25,639 --> 00:35:26,519
Her name is Tian Xin.

529
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:28,039
My neighbor.

530
00:35:32,079 --> 00:35:33,039
She needed my help with something.

531
00:35:33,599 --> 00:35:34,119
Let's talk inside.

532
00:35:58,239 --> 00:35:58,760
It's all right.

533
00:36:00,599 --> 00:36:01,320
I'm scared.

534
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:02,519
It's okay.

535
00:36:04,079 --> 00:36:04,760
I'm right here.

536
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:12,440
Thank you.

537
00:36:17,239 --> 00:36:18,159
What are you thanking me for?

538
00:36:20,159 --> 00:36:21,199
I can smell the noodles.

539
00:36:45,159 --> 00:36:46,519
A... a game.

540
00:36:57,599 --> 00:36:58,599
This is where I... where I sleep.

541
00:37:14,519 --> 00:37:15,440
Quite the player, aren't you?

542
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:18,280
You little punk.

543
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:19,320
Um, Brother Qiang...

544
00:37:19,960 --> 00:37:20,880
what did you need me for?

545
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:23,039
The client I told you to contact...

546
00:37:23,039 --> 00:37:24,159
how did that go?

547
00:37:24,280 --> 00:37:25,079
I reached out to them.

548
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:27,039
After testing your stuff, Brother Qiang,

549
00:37:27,159 --> 00:37:29,400
they said your product is top-notch.

550
00:37:29,559 --> 00:37:31,960
But they need two days before taking the goods.

551
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:33,039
They can't withdraw the cash right now.

552
00:37:33,039 --> 00:37:33,480
And...

553
00:37:34,119 --> 00:37:36,239
Brother Qiang, could you... could you give me two more days?

554
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:41,239
Brother Qiang?

555
00:37:52,079 --> 00:37:52,800
No, Brother Qiang...

556
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:54,280
T-This stuff, I...

557
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:56,199
I really showed it to the buyer!

558
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:58,039
But he said he couldn't get the cash right now,

559
00:37:58,039 --> 00:37:59,480
so I didn't let him sample it.

560
00:38:08,719 --> 00:38:09,159
Brother Qiang!

561
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:10,760
Brother Qiang, I was wrong, Brother Qiang!

562
00:38:11,519 --> 00:38:12,159
Listen, Brother Qiang...

563
00:38:12,480 --> 00:38:13,559
Brother Qiang, I was wrong, Brother Qiang!

564
00:38:14,519 --> 00:38:15,000
Brother Qiang!

565
00:38:15,199 --> 00:38:16,280
Brother Qiang, what you told me to do...

566
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:17,559
I really screwed it up, Brother Qiang!

567
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:18,880
Brother Qiang!

568
00:38:19,599 --> 00:38:20,440
Brother Qiang!

569
00:38:20,719 --> 00:38:21,320
Brother Qiang, I...

570
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:22,599
Brother Qiang, I was wrong, Brother Qiang!

571
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:23,199
Brother Qiang!

572
00:38:24,559 --> 00:38:26,719
Brother Qiang, listen to me, Brother Qiang!

573
00:38:27,199 --> 00:38:29,480
That task... that thing you told me to handle,

574
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:30,360
I really didn't dare!

575
00:38:30,719 --> 00:38:33,039
I can't afford to mess with Four-Legged Snake!

576
00:38:33,599 --> 00:38:35,159
Don't you think you had it coming?

577
00:38:35,559 --> 00:38:37,039
Brother Qiang gave you serious business,

578
00:38:37,159 --> 00:38:38,159
and you were playing games!

579
00:38:39,400 --> 00:38:40,519
Now listen to me carefully.

580
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:43,000
This is your last chance.

581
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:44,280
From now on, whatever task you're given,

582
00:38:44,400 --> 00:38:45,760
you'd better do it right.

583
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:48,199
If anyone dares get in your way,

584
00:38:48,599 --> 00:38:50,239
tell them to come find me. Got it?

585
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:52,519
U-Understood.

586
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:53,400
Understood.

587
00:38:56,320 --> 00:38:56,920
But...

588
00:38:59,360 --> 00:39:00,800
where should I tell them to find you?

589
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:05,440
Get up.

590
00:39:09,280 --> 00:39:10,039
Do you understand?

591
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:13,400
U-Understood.

592
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:16,079
Whatever Brother Qiang gives me to do from now on,

593
00:39:17,159 --> 00:39:18,159
I'll definitely do it right.

594
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:20,519
And what if you don't?

595
00:39:21,679 --> 00:39:22,840
If I don't...

596
00:39:24,840 --> 00:39:25,679
then I'll...

597
00:39:27,199 --> 00:39:28,320
I... I'll...

598
00:39:28,440 --> 00:39:29,039
You'll what?

599
00:39:30,119 --> 00:39:31,719
Th-Then...

600
00:39:31,920 --> 00:39:34,880
G-Game over, I guess.

601
00:39:38,199 --> 00:39:39,480
Over. That's it.

602
00:39:42,239 --> 00:39:42,639
Move.

603
00:40:17,559 --> 00:40:17,880
Brother Qiang.

604
00:40:22,880 --> 00:40:23,599
Let's go.

605
00:40:40,039 --> 00:40:40,480
Captain Lu.

606
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:42,519
Li Qiang just showed up at Xu Duoduo's place.

607
00:40:43,199 --> 00:40:43,960
Where is he now?

608
00:40:44,440 --> 00:40:44,840
He just left.

609
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:48,039
Should we send someone to tail him?

610
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:50,199
What did he want with Xu Duoduo?

611
00:40:50,840 --> 00:40:52,760
Just pressuring Xu Duoduo to do something for him.

612
00:40:52,880 --> 00:40:54,239
Nothing else new.

613
00:41:00,320 --> 00:41:01,000
Keep monitoring him.

614
00:41:01,599 --> 00:41:02,519
Don't make a move just yet.

615
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:03,440
Copy that.

616
00:41:09,920 --> 00:41:11,000
Li Qiang went to see Xu Duoduo.

617
00:41:12,320 --> 00:41:14,039
Have the mobile unit on standby

618
00:41:14,199 --> 00:41:14,880
to back up Li Xiao.

619
00:41:41,559 --> 00:41:43,639
Liang Wenbiao doesn't suspect you, does he?

620
00:41:45,039 --> 00:41:47,119
Doesn't seem like it so far.

621
00:41:48,400 --> 00:41:49,039
That's good.

622
00:41:49,400 --> 00:41:50,559
According to orders from above,

623
00:41:50,880 --> 00:41:52,960
you're to keep following up on Black Panther Club.

624
00:41:53,679 --> 00:41:55,519
Liang Wenbiao is a cautious man.

625
00:41:56,039 --> 00:41:58,400
His legitimate business is kept spotless.

626
00:41:58,960 --> 00:41:59,920
There are barely any flaws.

627
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:02,639
I need to find a chance to get into his room

628
00:42:02,679 --> 00:42:04,760
to see if I can find some clues and evidence.

629
00:42:05,679 --> 00:42:06,360
Don't take risks.

630
00:42:06,639 --> 00:42:07,199
Understood.

631
00:42:09,199 --> 00:42:10,440
I'll do everything I can

632
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:12,440
to carry out Operation Thunderbolt.

633
00:42:20,320 --> 00:42:21,280
From Gao Min's phone,

634
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:22,880
we found the number Qian Feng used.

635
00:42:23,239 --> 00:42:24,440
Telecom confirmed

636
00:42:24,679 --> 00:42:26,639
it was registered using someone else's ID.

637
00:42:27,039 --> 00:42:28,920
Right now, the phone is powered off.

638
00:42:29,079 --> 00:42:30,880
Its location can't be tracked.

639
00:42:31,239 --> 00:42:32,920
The SIM card was probably pulled out.

640
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:36,159
Checking the registry for "Qian Feng",

641
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:37,719
we found 29 people in total.

642
00:42:37,719 --> 00:42:39,719
But only these three match the age profile.

643
00:42:39,719 --> 00:42:40,199
Take a look.

644
00:42:42,480 --> 00:42:45,639
All three have legitimate families and jobs.

645
00:42:45,840 --> 00:42:47,079
And I've already contacted them.

646
00:42:47,400 --> 00:42:48,480
On the night of the 19th,

647
00:42:48,480 --> 00:42:50,320
when we arrested Gao Min,

648
00:42:50,599 --> 00:42:52,239
all three had alibis.

649
00:42:53,000 --> 00:42:55,920
So they can be ruled out of this case.

650
00:42:56,840 --> 00:42:57,400
Also,

651
00:42:57,880 --> 00:42:59,760
The trace evidence from Gao Min's home

652
00:42:59,880 --> 00:43:01,039
was run against the criminal database,

653
00:43:01,119 --> 00:43:02,519
but no matching profiles were found.

654
00:43:03,000 --> 00:43:04,239
For now, we can be certain

655
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:06,199
that the suspect has no criminal record.

656
00:43:06,280 --> 00:43:07,280
As for the Jiangyang police,

657
00:43:07,880 --> 00:43:09,559
they haven't found the supplier yet,

658
00:43:09,719 --> 00:43:10,800
or Cheng Weimin's whereabouts.

659
00:43:11,480 --> 00:43:13,679
All employees at Xinghai Trading Company

660
00:43:13,679 --> 00:43:16,400
denied any involvement in this drug case.

661
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:17,480
As for this Qian Feng,

662
00:43:18,480 --> 00:43:20,519
nobody has any info on him.

663
00:43:21,679 --> 00:43:22,239
By the way,

664
00:43:22,719 --> 00:43:24,599
how did you learn the name Qian Feng?

665
00:43:24,960 --> 00:43:25,800
When Zhuang Yan and I

666
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:27,400
went to Hongzhuang Garden to investigate,

667
00:43:27,400 --> 00:43:28,400
the old man at the convenience store told us.

668
00:43:29,239 --> 00:43:31,079
And when we interrogated Gao Min earlier,

669
00:43:31,239 --> 00:43:32,480
we brought up the name Qian Feng.

670
00:43:33,079 --> 00:43:34,159
Judging from her reaction,

671
00:43:34,519 --> 00:43:35,360
it shouldn't be wrong.

672
00:43:39,199 --> 00:43:40,880
It could also be an alias, though.
